    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Brainstorm Before You Build\r\n\r\nAI isn't just a builder - it's also a good brainstorming partner. When you know the *feeling* you want but not the *look*, ask for ideas first.\r\n\r\nEli made this page about his favorite book series, and he has a wish:\r\n\r\n*\"I wanted it to feel like the book - dark and mysterious with a bit of magic to it. It just looks like a default webpage right now.\"*\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. **Ask for ideas, not changes:** Tell AI Tutor about Eli's wish and ask for **three different style directions**, described in words.\r\n2. **Pick your favorite** (or mix two!).\r\n3. **Ask AI to apply it.** Then judge the preview against Eli's wish and Accept or Reject.\r\n\r\n> **Notice:** Brainstorming first means you choose the direction - instead of AI choosing for you.\r\n\r\nOnce the page feels dark, mysterious, and a bit magical, click **Continue**.",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "true",
    "widget_view": "false",
